    "body": "\\(\\tan\\left(\\alpha+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)=\\frac{1+\\tan\\alpha}{1-\\tan\\alpha}=\\frac{2-\\frac{\\sqrt3}{3}}{\\frac{\\sqrt3}{3}}=\\frac{6}{\\sqrt3}-1=2\\sqrt3-1\\)，选 B。"
   }
